      "japanese": "{自分|じぶん}の{成績|せいせき}を{誇|ほこ}る。",
      "english": "He brags about his grades.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14180_hokoru_ex5",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}はいつも{自分|じぶん}の{学歴|がくれき}を{誇|ほこ}っている。",
      "english": "He's always boasting about his educational background.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "14180_hokoru_ex6",
      "japanese": "{過去|かこ}の{栄光|えいこう}を{誇|ほこ}ってばかりいても{前|まえ}には{進|すす}めない。",
